{"text":{"en":{"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types &amp; Sizes</p> <h2>오일씰 형식 및 적용현황</h2> <p>오일씰은 스프링 유무, 더스트 립 유무, 외주(고무·금속) 구조에 따라 형식이 나뉩니다. 아래에서 형식을 고르면 해당 형식의 도면과 규격을 볼 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal Types &amp; Sizes</p> <h2>Oil Seal Types and Applications</h2> <p>Oil seal types are classified by whether they have a spring or a dust lip and by their outer construction (rubber or metal). Select a type below to see its drawing and sizes.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (실측 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">축</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">금속 케이스</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">스프링</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">주 립</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">더스트 립</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">오른쪽: 오일 측</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">왼쪽: 외부(먼지) 측</text> <defs> <marker id=\"ostArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경 = 축 지름) · D(외경 = 하우징 구멍 지름) · H(두께) — 표의 d·D·H 열이 이 위치입니다. TYPE에 따라 더스트 립·스프링 유무, 금속 케이스의 고무 피복 여부가 달라지며(예: 더스트 립이 없는 형식도 있음), 개념도 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Conceptual diagram for shape reference only (not a measured drawing) — cross-section of a typical oil seal (type with spring and dust lip)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"/> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"/> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"/> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Shaft</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"/> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"/> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"/> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#ostArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#ostArrow)\"/> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"/> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"/> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"/> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"/> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Metal case</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Spring</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Main lip</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Dust lip</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Right: oil side</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Left: outside (dust) side</text> <defs> <marker id=\"ostArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"/> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore = shaft diameter) · D (outer diameter = housing bore diameter) · H (thickness) — these are the d, D and H columns in the table. Depending on the TYPE, the presence of a dust lip or spring and whether the metal case is rubber-covered differ (e.g. some types have no dust lip), and the diagram’s proportions may differ from the actual product.</p>","스프링 있는 형식":"Types with Spring","스프링 없는 형식":"Types without Spring","기타":"Others","※ 카드를 누르면 형식별 도면과 규격표를 볼 수 있습니다. 도면은 당사 카탈로그 기준이며, 괄호 안은 같은 형상의 다른 표기입니다.":"※ Select a card to see the drawing and size table for each type. Drawings follow our catalog; names in parentheses are other designations for the same shape.","<a class=\"product-card\" href=\"oilseal_tc.html\"> <img class=\"p-icon-photo\" src=\"assets/oilseal_type_d.webp?v=wm3\" alt=\"TC형 오일씰 단면 도면\" loading=\"lazy\"> <h4>TC형</h4> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">규격 보기 →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" h